import sys
AN="Semi-realistic painterly guofeng portrait style, near-3D realistic rendering with soft natural light and fine detail, exactly matching the rendering of the reference portraits; full-body standing figure head to feet, centered, plain light parchment background, soft even light; fair porcelain skin; serene gentle neutral expression, soft eyes, closed lips or faint smile; elegant, slim, clearly adult; beautiful/handsome romantic-lead looks for everyone; face clearly visible, 3/4 or frontal view."
AGE={"a18":"about 20 years old","a26":"about 28 years old","a36":"about 40 years old, mature dignified","a51":"about 54 years old, dignified older beauty, faint fine lines, silver hints"}
ORN={"low":"Hair ornaments on ONE side of the head only, real gold hairpins (zan) with dangles/tassels and a flower like the style reference, no flat combs or plates, nothing jutting out sideways (no long bare gold stick poking out horizontally at the side of the bun; every pin tip is hidden inside the hair).","high":"Hair ornaments visible on BOTH sides of the head, real gold hairpins (zan) with dangles/tassels and flowers like the style reference, no flat combs or plates, nothing jutting out sideways."}
def p(pose,age,tier):
    return (AN+" Image 1 = old design sheet: take OUTFIT DESIGN ONLY (colours, embroidery, trims, hairstyle) and redraw as ONE full-body figure; the woman is the same woman as image 2 (her face only), "+AGE[age]+"; images 3-6 face only. Image 7 is THE style and fabric reference: match its rendering exactly. "
    "Near-3D semi-realistic rendering, soft volumetric shading on face and hair, NO dark contour line around face, nose or jaw, natural eye size (not big stylised eyes), soft individual hair strands, exactly matching the rendering of the style reference. "
    "Luminous smooth porcelain skin, soft even light, no grey or dark shading on the face, no nasolabial or under-eye lines, dewy flawless complexion. Bare clean forehead, no forehead mark, no huadian. "
    "Hands: "+pose+" (the item is really gripped by the hands, five fingers each); sleeves hang naturally ending near the hips. OUTER robe reaches the floor, no train. "+ORN[tier]+" Every hairpin inserted into the bun pointing upward or backward, dangling pearls hang down. Transparent background.")
if __name__=="__main__": print(p(sys.argv[1],sys.argv[2],sys.argv[3]))
